# Reverse-engineering probes: one-off scripts written to discover Grok's hidden
# endpoints (grok_api.Media, image quotas, pipeline templates). Useful locally
# and not part of the service -- the Dockerfile copies only from docker-api/ and
# nothing in the codebase imports them.
#
# Ignored by pattern rather than one by one on purpose: the next probe will be
# called probe_something_else.py, and what this prevents is a `git add -A`
# sweeping it into the repo unnoticed. That is exactly what happened in the
# deepseek repo (6f12c27).
probe_*.py
